{
  "uid": "fillmap-viewport-ab",
  "title": "FillMap · viewport A/B 부하 관측",
  "tags": ["fillmap", "msg-128"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "API 지연 p95 — /api/grids (endpoint별)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{uri=~\"/api/grids.*\"}[30s])) by (le, uri))",
          "legendFormat": "{{uri}} p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "요청 처리량 RPS — /api/grids (status별)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{uri=~\"/api/grids.*\"}[30s])) by (status)",
          "legendFormat": "status {{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "DB 커넥션 풀 (Hikari)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "hikaricp_connections_active{application=\"fillmap\"}",
          "legendFormat": "active"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "hikaricp_connections_pending{application=\"fillmap\"}",
          "legendFormat": "pending"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "hikaricp_connections{application=\"fillmap\"}",
          "legendFormat": "total"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "다음 패널 (첫 부하 실행 후 추가)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**k6 · postgres_exporter 패널은 첫 부하 실행 후 실제 메트릭명을 확인해 추가한다.**\n\n- **k6**(remote-write): `k6_http_req_duration...`, `k6_http_reqs_total`, `k6_vus` 등 → strategy A/B 태그로 p95·RPS 비교\n- **postgres_exporter**: `pg_stat_user_tables_idx_scan`(btree vs GiST 스캔), `pg_stat_activity_count` 등\n\nGrafana **Explore**로 메트릭명 확인 → 이 대시보드에 패널 추가 후 저장(JSON export → 이 파일 갱신)."
      }
    }
  ]
}
